00:13:51.000 --> 00:13:54.000
ApproTEC is a company started by Dr. Martin Fisher,

00:13:54.000 --> 00:13:57.000
who's a good friend of mine. He's a Ph.D. from Stanford.

00:13:57.000 --> 00:14:00.000
